Use MVVM + Repository patter with UseCases. 
- Domain defines contracts and usecases
- Data implementes contracts
- UI contains Blocs
- Bloc has access ONLY to usecases (via DI - getIt)
- Usecase gets data from repository and provides it to Bloc
- Repository gets data from service